  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mi>&#960;</mi></msubsup><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mo>-</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p>Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mo>-</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Replace&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;by&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></math>.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mo>-</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mo>-</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Since&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is an even function.</p><p>Now by the property of definite integration for even function.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mi>&#960;</mi></msubsup><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mo>-</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></msubsup><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mo>-</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></msubsup><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>&#8757;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>&#8757;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8704;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msubsup><menclose notation=\"right\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#960;x</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></menclose><mn>0</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></msubsup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p>",
